<!-- tools/macos-check case "sides" (MIT-0): written from a yakbd build, then edited by hand: the left-hand words shift and option select key maps 1 and 2, rightShift and rightOption key maps 3 and 4, which differ only in key code 0 (A or Ʀ, å or ɒ). -->
